·· intent ::= «In 2025, The year that Hid its Grace, Shunned Mercy and Disgraced forgiveness A storm of unequivocal proportions made its way through Walla Walla, WA 99362. My Wife, Stacey L Richard and myself, Nicolas R Richard were in the Eye of the storm. Unbenounced to us, The Storm entered into existence to test our Relationship, our marriage, and our absolution. Love need not apply. The eye died out and the inner and outer workings loaded it's ferocity aimed towards our daily living. Today, 7 months later on September 22nd 2026, I've walked the streets, slept in the streets, lost myself in the streets, died in the streets and now have risen through the ashes and fires of the same streets in pursuit of my Wife. I have not seen her for 7 months today and were married ten years with a Love that could never be broken by such trivial matters. I declare without declaration, Giving up is not an option any longer and I will scour, search, climb and fall, even enter into an agreement with death and Hades to find my wife. I am Lord of the Word and Word of the Lord and today my journey begins and will not end until answers are given.» ◼
